---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Trattamenti Viso">
  <section class="py-16 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-neutral-500">Macro-Area Viso</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#111111] mt-2">Medicina Estetica del Viso</h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-600 font-light mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Protocolli su misura per rughe d'espressione, ripristino dei volumi e qualità della pelle.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#111111]">Filler Acido Ialuronico</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Labbra • Zigomi • Volumi</p>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 font-light text-sm mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Ripristina i volumi persi e ridefinisce i contorni del volto in modo armonioso.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#111111]">Tossina Botulinica</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider">Fronte • Zampe di Gallina</p>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 font-light text-sm mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Distende le rughe d'espressione regalando uno sguardo riposato e naturale.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>